  "verses": {
    "verse": [
      [
        "Should auld acquaintance be forgot, and",
        "never brought to mind? Should",
        "auld acquaintance be forgot, and",
        "days of auld lang syne?"
      ],
      [
        "We twa hae run about the braes, and",
        "pu'd the gowans fine, but we've",
        "wander'd mony a weary foot sin",
        "auld lang syne."
      ],
      [
        "We twa hae paidl't i' the burn, from",
        "mornin sun till dine; but",
        "seas between us braid hae roar'd sin",
        "auld lang syne."
      ],
      [
        "And here's a hand, my trusty fiere, and",
        "gie's a hand o' thine; and we'll",
        "tak a right guid willie-waught, for",
        "auld lang syne."
      ],
      [
        "And surely ye'll be your pint-stowp, and",
        "surely I'll be mine; and we'll",
        "tak a cup o' kindness yet for",
        "auld lang syne."
      ]
    ]
  },
